cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "vec-trust-kit: trust diagnostics for virtual embryo / virtual cell models (Chinese, numpy-only)"
abstract: "A Chinese-language, numpy-only trust-diagnostics toolkit: a baseline ladder that admits a model only if it strictly beats copy_last / mean / linear, a split-conformal extrapolation audit under three held-out protocols with a graded verdict, and a three-layer license matrix. 10 tests, MIT, no GPU, no restricted competition data."
authors:
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Xing"
version: "v0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
url: "https://github.com/lm203688/vec-trust-kit"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lm203688/vec-trust-kit"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - "virtual cell"
  - "virtual embryo"
  - "conformal prediction"
  - "calibration"
  - "reproducibility"
